# JetAcademie Cursor & Agent Rules

@AGENTS.md

Please follow all conventions specified in AGENTS.md:
- Use `bun` exclusively as the JavaScript/TypeScript runtime (`bun install`, `bun test`, `bun dev`, `bun run build`). Never use `npm`, `yarn`, or `pnpm`.
- Preserve the auto-generated Next.js header block in `AGENTS.md`.
- Maintain the separation of concerns: Zustand for client UI state (`src/store/`), TanStack Query for server state (`src/lib/queries/`, `src/lib/query-client.ts`, `src/providers/query-provider.tsx`).
- Always run the quality verification loop before declaring completion: `bun test`, `bun run lint`, `bun run format:check`, and `bun run build`.
- Use conventional commits format: `type(scope): description`.
